## ⭐ Project Summary

**Toxic Comment Classification** is a beginner-friendly NLP project that demonstrates how machine learning can be used to automatically classify online comments as **Toxic or Non-Toxic**.

The project combines:

**NLP + TF-IDF + Multinomial Naive Bayes + Streamlit**

to create a simple end-to-end text classification system.
